# Cursor montage review (agent ship gate)

**Default for all motivation jobs:** Cursor agent vets speech + visuals. Code gates are off unless the user passes **`--code-gates`**.

## Build (default — no extra flags)

```powershell
python scripts/build_motivation_job.py `
  --slug ... `
  --broll-query "..." `
  --reuse-policy allow
```

Writes `cursor-review/` (SPEECH.md + REVIEW.md). Sequential speech excerpt + ranked options in SPEECH.md. Speech reuse fingerprint still applies.

Legacy automation: add `--code-gates`.

## Speech first (optional two-step)

```powershell
python scripts/build_motivation_job.py --slug ... --speech-review-only
```

Read `{job}/cursor-review/SPEECH.md` — ranked options + checklist. Then:

```powershell
python scripts/build_motivation_job.py --slug ... --broll-query "..." --speech-option 2
```

Or `--speech-start 142 --speech-duration 24`.

## After render — required before ship

1. Open `{job}/cursor-review/SPEECH.md` — **approve speech** (not code score).
2. Open `REVIEW.md` + PNGs under `final/` (0s, 2.5s, 5s; car opener if car job).
3. Tell user **SHIP** or **REMAKE** for speech + visuals together.

Cars: `.cursor/rules/car-exterior-frames.mdc` — full exterior 0–5s, no cabin.

Do **not** register/post until you pass visual + speech checks.

## Manual clip folder (e.g. broll-review)

```powershell
python scripts/prepare_cursor_montage_review.py `
  --clips-dir downloads/motivational/broll-review/luxury-cars `
  --subject "luxury car exterior" `
  --clip-sample 12 `
  --out-dir downloads/motivational/broll-review/luxury-cars/cursor-review
```

Sample stills only — user or agent rejects bad files before montage.

## Partial flags

| Flag | Effect |
|------|--------|
| `--no-vision` | Skip GPT-4o-mini only |
| `--no-frame-gate` | Skip download trim/drop; fps still on |
| `--no-segment-gate` | Random beat windows; no per-beat gate |
| `--skip-quality-gate` | Skip post-render `check_render_quality` |
| `--code-gates` | Automated vision/frame/speech-score/render gates (not default) |
| `--no-speech-score` | Sequential excerpt + SPEECH.md (default mode already does this) |
| `--speech-review-only` | Download + SPEECH.md only |
| `--speech-option N` | Pick ranked option from SPEECH.md |
| `--speech-start` / `--speech-duration` | Manual excerpt window |
